  "description": "The Dew-E has redefined what commuting means to riders all over the world. In fact, we’ve heard it’s the best part of going to work for some people. We love the ride quality of the Dew-E and the fact that it’s helping cut down on the number of cars on the road. The semi-integrated battery keeps the lines of the bike nice and clean, while the Shimano pedal-assist motor keeps every rider smiling no matter how far or how steep their ride. Complete with front and rear fenders and lights, the Dew-E is ready to rise and shine for the daily grind!",
